Fica: Phoria?! Sister wake up!
Phoria: I'm up.
Fica: What happened?
Phoria: He noticed me almost immediately. I made it as far as I could, but got overwhelmed by Shadow Beasts.
Fica: Oh...
Fica: Well, good thing the Retriever worked then!
Phoria: Yeah. Thanks Fica.
Fica: What do we do now?
Phoria: We try again.
